            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MAZZO"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A very simple throw together meal. I had cooked about 8 chops, I used 1 can cream of celery soup and 1 can cream of chicken soup then used 1 cup of milk. I also added 1 packet of onion soup mix that was suggested by another reviewer. It made a really nice gravy that we all had plenty of to pour over our mashed potatoes. You cant get much easier that this for supper! Thanks for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2005-02-20T05:31:01.810Z"
          },
          {
